00:00:00.075 --> 00:00:05.231
Artificial Intelligence AI is the simulation of human intelligence by machines—especially

00:00:05.381 --> 00:00:09.573
computer systems. That’s our working definition.
So what does that look

00:00:09.723 --> 00:00:14.205
like in real life?
Smart assistants like Siri and Alexa that listen and

00:00:14.355 --> 00:00:19.929
act.
Online translators that swap languages on the fly.
Recommendation systems

00:00:20.079 --> 00:00:24.573
that nudge you toward the next song, show, or product.
Robotic vacuum cleaners

00:00:24.723 --> 00:00:28.473
that map your space and learn better routes.
Autonomous vehicles making

00:00:28.623 --> 00:00:33.071
sense of the road in real time.
And healthcare diagnostics spotting patterns

00:00:33.221 --> 00:00:38.307
in scans and labs faster than we could alone.
Bottom line: AI is machines

00:00:38.457 --> 00:00:41.163
doing human-like thinking—at speed and scale.”

